id=garnet_oos16_uw_fix
name=Garnet Native Lens Switch & Camera Fix
version=v1.3
versionCode=130
author=Vael
description=Universal zero-overlay anti-bootloop camera & lens switch fix for garnet (OOS16, HyperOS CN/Global/ID/EU, AOSP; Magisk/KSU/APatch): post-boot bind-mounts only (zero early-boot /vendor overlay), strict ELF/pattern checks with safe fallback, native Photo/Video SAT lens switching, surgical Titan570 Luma-only NR bypass (100% Chroma NR active), active 0.6x UW LDC, and boosted video bitrates.
